# Compiling CPU Only

Load intel to ensure icc and intel MPI are available

`. /etc/environment-modules/software/intel/2023.2.0/setvars.sh`

Enter the ref folder to compile a reference version of miniMD.

`make -f Makefile.default` appears to work fine and uses mpicxx to compile using Intel MPI and g++.

`make test` indicates tests pass for the reference implementation

# Compiling Kokkos

Additionally we load nvhpc to get CUDA read to go

`module load nvhpc`

This changes the default compiler to nvcc, not g++.

Then go into the kokkos folder and run the following to compile.

`make KOKKOS_PATH=/mnt/public/tgmaxson/HPC_Compile/kokkos/`

